id: E2026101515311
title: Conan适配版本与Perl XSLoader模块版本分别绑定
trigger_tool: perl|conan|make
phase: runtime-validation|testing
error_signature: XS object version does not match bootstrap parameter|adaptation version differs from module VERSION
severity: 2
category: perl, runtime, compatibility
match_keywords: XSLoader.{0,40}VERSION|bootstrap.{0,40}version|适配后缀.{0,30}模块
root_cause: Conan包版本是适配制品身份，Perl模块VERSION同时参与XSLoader引导契约；二者不能因包后缀递增而机械同步。
affected_scope: Conan适配版本与Perl XSLoader模块版本分别绑定
verification_cmd: 同源未改模块与完整原make test，实际Conan安装消费者和目标运行语义分别核验。
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-original-language-runtime-contract
rec_description: 保留官方PM与XS来源及模块VERSION；只递增真实Conan适配版本，核对实际安装PM哈希及XSLoader调用，再执行原测试和真实泄漏/非泄漏API。
rec_command: make test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: original module and full upstream test source with real installed package binding
